and bases; and renewable parts, including solar panel components. In addition, the company offers press parts; two-wheeler fairings, seat and side covers, luggage boxes, helmets, and headlight housings; outer and inner rear-view mirrors for vehicles; wishbone assemblies; tri hexavalent nickel chrome plating of mild and stainless steel; automotive systems comprising clutch and pressure plates, flywheels, control arms, crankshafts, housings, hubs, and calipers; home appliances consisting of freezer grills, fridge baskets, and thermostat parts; and home security devices, including household locks and bolts, as well as operates a rose plantation. It exports its products. The company was formerly known as Badve Engineering Limited and changed its name to Belrise Industries Limited in August 2022. Belrise Industries Limited was founded in 1988 and is headquartered in Pune, India."}}